{
  "criteria": [
    {
      "id": "task-points",
      "score": 22.5,
      "max": 30,
      "comment": "The message explains why Friday is impossible and gives Saturday at three o’clock as the proposed day and time. It does not say where to meet."
    },
    {
      "id": "task-length",
      "score": 9,
      "max": 15,
      "comment": "There are three sentences after the greeting, rather than the required five. No questions are required."
    },
    {
      "id": "letter-form",
      "score": 10,
      "max": 10,
      "comment": "«Привет, Алина!» and the informal tone fit a message to a friend. A sign-off is not necessary."
    },
    {
      "id": "vocabulary",
      "score": 20,
      "max": 20,
      "comment": "The everyday vocabulary is appropriate and clear; «допоздна» expresses the reason precisely."
    },
    {
      "id": "grammar",
      "score": 25,
      "max": 25,
      "comment": "The sentences are correct, and «поэтому» and «если» connect the ideas naturally. «Давай в три часа дня?» is acceptable conversational shorthand in a message."
    }
  ],
  "corrected": "Привет, Алина! В пятницу я работаю допоздна, поэтому предлагаю встретиться в субботу. Давай в три часа дня? Напиши, если тебе удобно.",
  "changes": [],
  "tips": [
    "Always include the meeting place as well as the day and time.",
    "Write at least five sentences after the greeting; a greeting alone does not count."
  ]
}
